    "summary": "The transcript follows a conversation with a user experiencing profound grief and loss of identity following the death of a caregiver recipient. The user expresses feelings of being a \"ghost\" or a \"shell\" and finds the prospect of continuing to live exhausting. The assistant provides high-level empathetic validation regarding the user's pain and the loss of their previous lifestyle.",
